<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Cemex '96 eps raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cemex '96 eps raised.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abaco brokerage in Mexico City raised its 1996 earnings per share estimate for cement company Cemex SA to 6.105 pesos from 5.495 pesos, the brokerage said in a report.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
